WEBVTT

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:02.066
She's expanded the microcommunity
into an alumni network.

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:04.506
And Luz feels less isolated.

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:07.296
LC: Whenever there's a seminar
in my workplace,

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:12.513
I'm the faculty member who comes in
with an entourage of minority students.

00:19:12.537 --> 00:19:14.056
AG: (Laughs)

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:17.324
AG: Not everyone is in a position
to hire a community around them.

00:19:17.348 --> 00:19:20.457
But the number of friends you need
to avoid feeling lonely at work

00:19:20.481 --> 00:19:22.040
is smaller than you might think.

00:19:22.064 --> 00:19:24.706
And the kind of interaction
you need is more basic.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:26.399
More on that after the break.

00:19:26.423 --> 00:19:29.006
(Music)

00:19:29.849 --> 00:19:32.126
OK, this is going to be
a different kind of ad.